			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Sync Element submodule for expanded IPC parameter utilities\n\nUpdate the Element submodule to commit c3502e8 to integrate advanced parameter extraction helpers in the `Utilities::Params` module.\n\n**Mountain:** Add typed helper functions (`i64_at`, `u64_at_or`, `obj_str`, `obj_val`) to handle both positional array and JSON object payloads without inline boilerplate. Refactor the `CreateEffectForRequest` tree (covering Debug, LanguageFeatures, SCM, Secrets, StatusBar, Terminal, TreeView, UserInterface, and Webview) to utilize these new utilities. This replaces verbose `get().and_then().unwrap_or()` chains with unified parsing logic, ensuring consistent default handling for handles, strings, numbers, and boolean flags across all IPC request handlers.\n\nThese changes further reduce code duplication in the native backend dispatch layer and reinforce the project's Effect-based architectural principles.",
			"SHA": "14f77c5187673353c5225d40296661a55b0ccc6a"
		},
