			"Message": "chore(Land): Sync Element submodule for IPC refactoring and build refresh\n\nUpdate the Element git submodule from 07cf2025 to b20c1483 to integrate build pipeline refreshes and IPC standardization across the Cocoon extension host and Mountain native backend.\n\n**Cocoon:** Regenerate all ESBuild artifacts in `Target/` and update `Source/Generated/RouteManifest.ts` with the current compilation timestamp, ensuring the extension host bootstrap and RPC handlers remain synchronized with upstream service layer changes.\n\n**Mountain:** Refactor `WindowUI` and `Workspace` IPC handlers to utilize new centralized utility functions (`array_unwrap`, `uri_from_params`, `ensure_array`) from the `Utilities::Params` module. This replaces inline conditional logic for unwrapping JSON arrays and normalizing URI parameters, eliminating duplicated type checks across Tauri event handlers.\n\nThese changes maintain binary artifact consistency for the extension host and further reduce boilerplate in the native backend dispatch layer, reinforcing the project's Effect-based architectural principles.",
			"SHA": "bcec76b19dcdaa5c6f1be80d14f80652d4398344"
